---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site.mjs';
---

<Base
  title="Legal & Compliance | The Funding Desk"
  description="Regulatory and legal information for The Funding Desk."
>
  <section class="masthead" style="padding-bottom:1rem;">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal &amp; compliance</span>
      <h1>The small print, in plain English</h1>
      <p class="sub">Placeholder regulatory statement — replace with final wording from your compliance advisers before launch.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0.5rem;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.4rem;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Regulation</h2>
        <p>{site.name} (placeholder, company no. {site.companyNo}) is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority as
          a consumer credit firm under {site.fca}. <b>Commercial finance, including most bridging loans and all business lending,
          is generally unregulated</b>: these products are not covered by the Financial Ombudsman Service or the Financial Services
          Compensation Scheme except as required by law.</p>
        <p>Our guides are general information, not financial advice. Bridging finance normally requires a clear exit strategy, and
          you should confirm figures in a written offer rather than relying on any illustrative example here.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.4rem;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Representative example</h2>
        <p>Facility £300,000 arranged over 12 months at 0.64% per month (interest-only). Monthly interest £1,920; arrange fee
          £6,000 (2%). Total payable £310,920 including fees. <b>Representative 21.8% APR.</b> Rates vary with LTV, term and risk;
          exact terms are confirmed in a written offer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.4rem;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Cookies</h2>
        <p>This site stores a single consent cookie in your browser before running any analytics or personalisation scripts. You can
          withdraw or change consent through the banner or your browser settings. The site has no advertising cookies and does not
          sell your data.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Complaints</h2>
        <p>If you are unhappy with our service, tell us — every complaint goes to a director. If you remain dissatisfied and the
          complaint concerns a regulated activity, you may refer it to the Financial Ombudsman Service (date placeholder — replace
          with live contact details).</p>
      </div>

      <p class="disclosure" style="margin-top:1.6rem;">{site.footerNote}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>